+   *  `CheckCaptures.recheckDefDef`; consulted by `Capability.acceptsLevelOf`.
+   */
+  val contextResultClosures: EqHashMap[Symbol, Symbol] = EqHashMap()
+
   // ------ Error diagnostics -----------------------------
 
   /** Warnings relating to upper approximations of capture sets with
